 12.</strong> Taiho Oncology and Cullinan reported that <strong>zipalertinib =
plus chemotherapy met the Phase 3 REZILIENT3 primary endpoint</strong>, produ=
cing a statistically significant and clinically meaningful progression-free-s=
urvival improvement in previously untreated EGFR exon 20 insertion-mutated NS=
CLC. The companies intend to use the interim results to pursue U.S. approval.=
 <a href=3D"https://www.taihooncology.com/us/news/zipalertinib-plus-chemother=
apy-meets-primary-endpoint-of-progression-free-survival-in-planned-interim-an=
alysis-of-phase-3-rezilient3-trial-in-first-line-egfr-exon-20-insertion-mutat=
ion-non-small-cell-lung-cancer/?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com" style=3D"color:#1a5=
e9a;text-decoration:underline;">Taiho Oncology+1</a></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">That matters because this molecular su=
bset already has targeted options, notably J&amp;J=E2=80=99s amivantamab-base=
d treatment. Zipalertinib therefore does not merely fill an unmet-treatment v=
acuum; it potentially <strong>challenges an established targeted regimen in f=
irst line</strong>.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What it tells us.</strong> The=
 competitive center of precision oncology continues moving earlier. Successfu=
l drugs aimed at relatively rare molecular alterations can create meaningful =
franchises if they capture newly diagnosed patients rather than waiting until=
 multiple prior treatments fail.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">There is also a modality question. Zip=
alertinib is an oral small-molecule EGFR inhibitor. If eventual detailed data=
 show competitive efficacy with a cleaner or more convenient treatment burden=
 than antibody-based regimens, convenience itself could become strategically =
meaningful.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>Watch next:</strong> the actua=
l PFS hazard ratio, CNS activity, toxicity, regulatory timing, and comparison=
 with J&amp;J=E2=80=99s Rybrevant-based standard.</p>
