;text-decoration:underline;">Reuters</a></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What changed strategically:</s=
trong> approval still looks far from assured, but outright rejection is no lo=
